{
  "spec": "CONTROL.md §14.2 (the notice), §1: never on the strength of a bearer token",
  "note": "A notice carries no session, words, folder, level or tool: only the closed set of short typed fields. Any other member, or a broken one, drops it whole: it is acked `refused` with `bad_notice` and runs nothing, even where the rest of it would match card-todo.",
